[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "外、ドンパチやってて騒がしいね……くぅぅもどかしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All that fighting outside is making such a racket... Ugh, this is so frustrating!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼雲城ごと壊れないかが心配だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm worried the whole castle might collapse at this rate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この足音は……コウセン！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those footsteps... Kosen!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ助けは来ていないようだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems help hasn't arrived for you yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちを奪われないように\n守りに来たの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you come to guard us so we wouldn't be taken away?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢の命令はそうだったな。\nだが、そのような命令、今となってはもうどうでもいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was Kaburaya's order, yes. But such orders no longer matter to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "我が式神が、奴の敗れたところを見ていたわ。\nあやつ、正気を取り戻しおった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My familiar witnessed her defeat. That fool has regained her senses."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアたち、やったんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria and the others did it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あまり喜んでもいられない状況ね。\n敗軍の将が牢に来て取る行動といえば……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We can't celebrate just yet. When a defeated general comes to the prison, there's only one thing they're planning..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう、人質よ。お前らを盾にして逃げおおせ\n再起を図らせてもらうとしよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Precisely—hostages. I'll use you as shields to escape and plot my return."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで俺が人質ってことか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I'm the hostage, is that it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人質は一人でいい。ちょうどおあつらえ向きに\n一人離れている者がいるのでな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "One hostage will suffice. How convenient that there's someone separated from the group."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "美女に人質にされるならともかく、ご免だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being taken hostage by a beautiful woman is one thing, but I'll pass on this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐわっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gwah?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元は武士ってね！\nやっとこれで少しは皆の役に立てた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was a warrior once! This is my time to be useful to everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この牢獄では陰陽術も使えぬゆえ……コウセン、\n貴様が一人で来た今が脱獄の好機！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since onmyoji arts cannot be used in this prison... Kosen, now that you've come alone, you're vulnerable!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぬうぅ、ぬかったわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh, a miscalculation!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――とでも言うと思ったか？\nすべて計算のうちよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not! This was all part of my plan!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "貴様らまとめて、人質にしてくれるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll take all of you as hostages!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "危ない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Look out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わわっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のは、陰陽術ではないぞ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That wasn't onmyoji magic..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "忍術でも、礫や矢の類でもございませぬ……\n今のは……コウセン、こやつ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nor ninjutsu, nor stones or arrows... That was... Kosen, what are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐわあああぁっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gwaaaaaah?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、不意を突かせてもらいます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll catch you off guard then!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その声は……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That voice...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お待たせ、みんな！\n助けにきたよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone! We're here to rescue you!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハンマー現着！\u3000みんな無事！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did someone call for a hammer?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなぁ……！\u3000待ってたよー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone...! We've been waiting for you!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちいっ、挟み撃ちは分が悪い！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch, being caught between two forces puts me at a disadvantage!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "牢屋にも隠し通路を！？\nよっぽど工作が好きな奴だなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A secret passage in the prison too?! This guy really loves his schemes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それより、コウセンをがっつり追わなきゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "More importantly, we need to pursue him!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。諸悪の根源、逃がしてはなりませぬ！\n後を追いましょう！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. We cannot let the root of all evil escape! Let's go!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]